  "body": "Whether you are starting out, slowing down, looking for a smart investment, or simply wanting a home that gives you more time to enjoy life, this modern townhouse deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nAPPROX 8 years young, situated in the heart of Stanmore Bay, this stylish  townhouse combines modern living with an easy-care lifestyle. With beaches, schools, shops, cafes and everyday amenities all within easy reach, convenience is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold 347m2; section, the property offers approximately 152m2; of modern living, giving you the space you need without the maintenance that comes with a larger property.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you will find a light-filled, open-plan living and dining area with a lovely sense of space and an easy flow to the outdoor area. It is a home designed for everyday living - comfortable, practical and easy to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThere are three bedrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite, plus a modern family bathroom. The fully fenced section provides a safe and private space.\r\n\r\nAnd there is plenty to appreciate behind the scenes too. The home is fully insulated and double glazed, with a heat pump, gas and electric appliances, and underfloor heating in the bathrooms. It is also Healthy Homes compliant, making it an attractive option for investors.\r\n\r\nFor first-home buyers, it offers a chance to step into a modern home in a popular coastal community.\r\n\r\nFor those looking to downsize or become empty nesters, it provides comfortable, low-maintenance living without giving up space - and the perfect lock-up-and-leave lifestyle for those who want the freedom to travel.\r\n\r\nFor investors, the freehold title, modern construction and Healthy Homes compliance make this property well worth considering, with a great tenant already in place who would be happy to stay. The tenant enjoys the comfort, easy-care living and excellent location - a genuine 10/10 for lifestyle and convenience.\r\n\r\nWhatever stage of life you are at, this could be the easy-care move you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nDon't Just Scroll Past This One - you need to see what makes 41 Sanremo Lane different.\r\nIf Stanmore Bay is on your list, make sure this one is on your must-see list too.\r\n\r\nGenuine opportunity. Genuine choice. Are you ready to buy?\r\n\r\nOpen Home - Sunday's,  Please call for the viewing time.\r\n\r\nDon't leave it until the last minute. Come along to one of our open homes, have a look, ask your questions and decide if this is the one you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nSee you at the open home!",
